    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd86The traditional goose ring-toss game is here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd4fCountdown: One! Two! Three! Toss! Toss as many as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd29Bring your talent to these locations below!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the farm, the geese don\u2019t want to end up as dinner combos. \ud83c\udf56\ud83d\ude2d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858180/extras/43f282109c962e73127a018b3350dd45.poster.avif?t=1752496479\" width=568 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858180/extras/43f282109c962e73127a018b3350dd45.webm?t=1752496479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the polar region, the geese don\u2019t want to become down jackets. \ud83e\udde3\ud83e\udd76</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858180/extras/1c50199b2a937d72f24aa88da81fe58c.poster.avif?t=1752496479\" width=568 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858180/extras/1c50199b2a937d72f24aa88da81fe58c.webm?t=1752496479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the desert, the geese are parched and desperate for water. \ud83d\udd25\ud83e\udd75</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858180/extras/fb24f841a21587ab008a4e2ac55231b9.poster.avif?t=1752496479\" width=568 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858180/extras/fb24f841a21587ab008a4e2ac55231b9.webm?t=1752496479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the stadium, compete for the title of Ring Toss Champion! \ud83e\udd47\ud83e\udd47</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858180/extras/60094d3f6e76dfd942579ad204d7c570.poster.avif?t=1752496479\" width=568 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858180/extras/60094d3f6e76dfd942579ad204d7c570.webm?t=1752496479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
